{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.71:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Vacchapāla:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.71:1.1"], "en": "“By one who perceives the exceedingly subtle and refined meaning,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
