{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.71:1.3", "PA_thag_1.71:1.4"], "en": "\"For one who has cultivated the virtue of the elders, nibbāna is indeed not difficult to attain. ...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
